## 4. Alternative Optimized Solution (Custom Sort Key)

```python
class Solution:
    def sortIt(self, arr):
        arr.sort(
            key=lambda num: (0, -num) if num % 2 == 1 else (1, num)
        )

        return arr
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n log n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(n) due to sorting key storage

